    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4104651396",
      "Source": "(Requires Pure IndoRaptor DNA to make.) This Genome is no different from Indom Genome 1, just an alternate way to craft.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"（需要纯暴虐迅猛龙基因才能制作。）该基因组与暴虐基因组1号并无区别，只是另一种制作方式而已。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
