      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4269365575",
      "Source": "DNA Extractor",
      "Trans": {"SC":"基因提取器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2647883397",
      "Source": "Requires Power Cells to function. Put required creature remains in this machine to extract small amounts of DNA from them. It works like a forge where you have no specific blueprint since you can extract DNA from multiple creature parts of the same creature. Remains such as eggs, Fertilized Eggs, alpha drops and regular drops of that specific dino will work. The amount of DNA / Petri Dishes you get depends on the creature part, for example Fertilized eggs give more than non fertilized eggs. (Dinosaur Remains allowed are Giga, Rex, Therizino, Raptor, Carno.)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"需要能量电池才能运行。将所需的生物遗骸(战利品)放入这台机器中，可从中提取少量DNA。它的运作方式类似熔炉，无需特定蓝图，因为你可以从同一生物的多个身体部位中提取DNA。诸如特定恐龙的蛋、受精卵、精英龙掉落物和普通掉落物都适用。你获得的DNA数量/培养皿数量取决于生物部位，例如受精卵比未受精卵提供的更多。（允许使用的恐龙遗骸包括南方巨兽龙、霸王龙、镰刀龙、迅猛龙、肉食牛龙。）","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3091691573",
      "Source": "GMH Incubator",
      "Trans": {"SC":"GMH孵化器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1960674013",
      "Source": "Must contain Power Cells to run. Hatches ONLY Genetically Modified Hybrid Eggs (crafted eggs). NOT Fertilized Hybrid eggs that are received from breeding.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"必须装入能量电池才能运行。仅孵化转基因蛋（手工制作的蛋）。不孵化通过繁殖获得的受精蛋。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3615563689",
      "Source": "Rex Petri Dish",
      "Trans": {"SC":"霸王龙培养皿","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2613817562",
