    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::101691268",
      "Source": "These power cells are what power all of the machines and equippment used to create hybrids.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些能量电池为所有用于基因工程的机器和设备提供动力。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
