      "Trans": {"SC":"受精的Gen2-暴虐迅猛龙蛋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::322343214",
      "Source": "GE MoroRaptor Egg",
      "Trans": {"SC":"暴虐迅猛龙基因蛋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2922338097",
      "Source": "In order to hatch, place this egg into a GMH Incubator, left click on the egg, then click the button that appears labeled \"hatch egg\" and hatch it! This Specific Genetically Created (Crafted) Egg can only be hatched in the GMH Incubator. Fertilized Eggs obtained from breeding can be hatched Normally (NOT IN THE GMH Incubator)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"要孵化这枚蛋，需将其放入GMH孵化器中，左键点击蛋，然后点击出现的 “孵化蛋” 按钮进行孵化！这种特定的基因培育（手工制作）蛋只能在GMH孵化器中孵化。通过繁殖获得的受精蛋可正常孵化（不可在GMH孵化器中孵化）。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::94113687",
      "Source": "GE MoroRaptor Gen 2 Egg",
      "Trans": {"SC":"Gen2-暴虐迅猛龙基因蛋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2884518478",
      "Source": "In order to hatch, place this egg into a GMH Incubator, left click on the egg, then click the button that appears labeled \"hatch egg\" and hatch it! This Specific Genetically Created (Crafted) Egg can only be hatched in the GMH Incubator. Fertilized Eggs obtained from breeding can be hatched Normally (NOT IN THE GMH Incubator) MoroRaptor Gen 2 has color regions and Normal MoroRaptors have none.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"要进行孵化，请将这枚蛋放入GMH孵化器，左键点击蛋，然后点击出现的标有 “孵化蛋” 的按钮进行孵化！这种特定的基因培育（手工制作）蛋只能在GMH孵化器中孵化。通过繁殖获得的受精蛋可正常孵化（不可在 GMH 孵化器中孵化）。二代暴虐迅猛龙有颜色分区，而普通暴虐迅猛龙则没有。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4153715304",
      "Source": "IndoRaptor has tough natural hide that can hold up against most things.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"暴虐迅猛龙有着坚硬的外壳，可以充当天然的护甲。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3786996200",
      "Source": "Moro Raptor Tooth",
      "Trans": {"SC":"暴虐迅猛龙牙齿","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1417159281",
      "Source": "This trophy proves you are a skilled hybrid killer. Perhaps you can use this to create another creature....",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个战利品证明你是一名技艺高超的杂交生物杀手。或许你可以用它来创造另一种生物……","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1685966126",
      "Source": "Moro Rex Rib",
      "Trans": {"SC":"暴虐霸王龙肋骨","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2239060539",
      "Source": "Lockwoods Trike Skull Monument",
      "Trans": {"SC":"洛克伍德三角龙颅骨纪念碑","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2495879342",
      "Source": "A Special Trophy and gravesite for a certain hybrid. ;)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个特殊的战利品，也是某个杂交生物的墓地。;)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4095990967",
      "Source": "The Indominus Rex has tough hide that acts as natural armor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"暴虐霸王龙有着坚硬的外壳，可以充当天然的护甲。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3702417872",
      "Source": "Genetically Engineered Moro Rex Egg",
      "Trans": {"SC":"暴虐霸王龙基因蛋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3057666413",
      "Source": "In order to hatch, place this egg into a GMH Incubator and hatch it! This Specific Genetically Created (Crafted) Egg can only be hatched in the GMH Incubator. Fertilized Eggs obtained from breeding can be hatched Normally (NOT IN THE GMH Incubator)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"要孵化这枚蛋，需将其放入GMH孵化器中进行孵化！这种特定的基因培育（人工制作）蛋只能在GMH孵化器中孵化。通过繁殖获得的受精蛋可正常孵化（不可在GMH孵化器中孵化）。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
