    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3336863733",
      "Source": "This costume can be used to make your MoroRex look just like a skeleton! Spooky!<#RN#><#RN#>Can be obtained by either Crafting it from specific resources OR by killing a wild MoroRex Gen 2.",
